==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|inf=[[to]] [[calm]] [[down]]|calms down|calming down|calmed down}}

# {{intransitive}} To [[become]] less [[excited]], [[intense]], or [[angry]].
#: '''''Calm down''' before you hurt somebody.''
# {{transitive}} To [[cause]] to become less excited, intense, or angry.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to become less excited}} [[chill]], [[chill out]], [[chillax]], [[relax]], [[unwind]]
* {{sense|to cause become less excited}} [[chill out]], [[relax]], [[hose down]]

